From bf387e3607c487acf72f386fa7dc1846f98e13b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harsha Nanda <harshanandak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 23:59:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add the forge profile command group

Without a command surface the registry and the profiles are unreachable: a user
still has to hand-edit gates, rails and protected paths one at a time to change
how a repo ships. list/show/apply/create/save/dump/export/import/delete make the
flip two commands and zero hand-edits, show derives the active regime rather than
trusting a stored label, and dump prints the fully-resolved state so nothing
about the regime is hidden.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
